<title>UK: British Land half year profits leap 81 pct.</title>
<headline>British Land half year profits leap 81 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence) diluted    6.1		    vs 3.7</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.92		   vs 2.78</p>
<p> Pretax		     34.2		   vs 18.9</p>
<p> Gross rental income    147.8		  vs 108.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 25.5 and 35.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - British Land Plc -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
